# Usage

## Run the main script:

```bash
python main.py
```

If your project supports field-based processing, you can use it like:


```python
from main import process_field
result = process_field(image, "VIN", config)
print(result)
```

Configuration
The behavior of the pipeline can be adjusted in config.py.

Typical configurable items may include:

OCR engine settings
Threshold values for preprocessing
ROI coordinates or detection rules
Validation rules
Dictionary paths
Output
Processed results are exported to the export/ folder.

The output may include:

extracted text
structured JSON
validation status
corrected values
